2026-09-14  Christian Brunello  <brncrs@gmail.com>

	Compatibility with older GLib and MySQL client libraries.

	* configure.ac: Require GLib >= 2.44. Add AC_CHECK_FUNCS for
	g_memdup2, g_ptr_array_copy, g_ptr_array_steal and
	g_string_replace; AC_CHECK_DECL for MYSQL_OPT_RECONNECT.
	* lib/glib-compat.h, lib/glib-compat.c: New files. Provide
	fallbacks when those GLib APIs are missing.
	* lib/internals.h, src/internals.h: Include glib-compat.h.
	* lib/Makefile.am: Build glib-compat and add src/ to include path
	for config.h.
	* src/Makefile.am: Add lib/ to include path for glib-compat.h.
	* lib/mysql-client.c: Use MYSQL_OPT_RECONNECT only when declared.

	Bug fixes.

	* lib/server.c (st_server_dup_outputs): Duplicate outputs with
	copy_st_output instead of copying inputs.
	* lib/client.c: Free allocated name and description after handling
	InputChanged and OutputChanged D-Bus signals.

